---
/**
 * apps/[slug].astro — Individual app page (/apps/[slug])
 *
 * Static generation: one page per entry in the `apps` content collection.
 * Each app maps to a Calculator component via CALCULATOR_MAP.
 * The markdown body (methodology + sources + limitations) is rendered below
 * the calculator via the AppLayout "methodology" named slot.
 *
 * Adding a new app:
 *  1. Create apps/web/src/content/apps/{slug}.md  (public repo — metadata)
 *  2. Create {slug}/Calculator.astro in drajb/gekro-apps, then commit + push there
 *     (private repo — implementation). apps-private is NOT a submodule: it's
 *     gitignored and cloned fresh at build time (HEAD of main), so there is no
 *     ref to update here.
 *  3. Add one import + one entry to CALCULATOR_MAP below. The next build clones
 *     HEAD of gekro-apps automatically and picks up the new Calculator.
 */

